allow: its two front edges are joined in front by one small, CLEARLY VISIBLE clasp (a frog button or small gold clasp) — the clasp may sit anywhere on the front, at the neckline or a little lower, but it is always there and clearly drawn; below the clasp the front opens so the square collar stays visible; the NECK always fully bare, no collar of any kind around the neck, never a stand collar, never hiding it,  # owner L2187 via ROOT-B4
